### 6.2 NBFCs

**Sector profile:** `NBFC`
**Critical difference from Banks:** Asset-Liability Management (ALM) is paramount; cost-of-funds trends drive margin compression risk.

**Fundamental Score:**

```
Fundamental_NBFC = 
    (Asset_Quality × 0.22) +
    (Profitability × 0.18) +
    (Capital_Adequacy × 0.13) +
    (ALM_Strength × 0.17) +
    (Borrowing_Cost_Trend × 0.10) +
    (Growth × 0.10) +
    (Governance × 0.05) +
    (Valuation × 0.05)
```

#### ALM Strength (unique to NBFCs)

```
ALM_Strength = 
    (Short_Term_Mismatch_Score × 0.40) +
    (Liability_Diversification_Score × 0.30) +
    (Liquidity_Coverage_Score × 0.30)
```

| Metric | Formula | Source |
|---|---|---|
| Short_Term_Mismatch | 100 if 0–1Y bucket has positive gap; scale down if gap exceeds 20% of borrowings | `nse_financials_quarterly` (ALM tables in NBFC XBRL) |
| Liability_Diversification | LIB(CP_dependence%, floor=10, ceiling=40) | Borrowing mix from annual disclosures |
| Liquidity_Coverage | HIB(LCR%, floor=100, ceiling=200) | Disclosed in quarterly results |

#### Borrowing Cost Trend

```
Borrowing_Trend_Score = 100 − ((Current_CoF − YoY_CoF) × 20)

Where CoF = Cost of Funds (Interest Expense / Avg Borrowings)
Stable or declining CoF = high score
50 bps increase = score drops by 10
```

#### NBFC-Specific Profitability

Replace bank's NIM with **Spread**:

```
Spread = Yield_on_Advances − Cost_of_Funds
Spread_Score = HIB(Spread%, floor=3, ceiling=7)

RoA target for NBFCs is higher than banks:
RoA_Score = HIB(RoA%, floor=1.5, ceiling=3.5)
```

#### NBFC Red Flags

| Red Flag | Penalty |
|---|---|
| `CRISIL/ICRA_DOWNGRADE` | −20 |
| `ALM_STRESS_IN_COMMENTARY` (event_analyzer signal) | −15 |
| `PROMOTER_GROUP_LEVERAGE_CONCERN` | −15 |
| `SEGMENT_CONCENTRATION` (one segment > 40% AUM) | −10 |
| `SUDDEN_AUM_DECLINE` (> 10% QoQ) | −10 |

