### 6.4 IT Services

**Sector profile:** `IT`

**Fundamental Score:**

```
Fundamental_IT = 
    (Growth × 0.28) +
    (Profitability × 0.23) +
    (Operational_Metrics × 0.18) +
    (Client_Health × 0.13) +
    (Governance × 0.08) +
    (Valuation × 0.10)
```

#### Growth

```
Growth = 
    (CC_Revenue_Growth_Score × 0.55) +
    (Deal_TCV_Growth_Score × 0.25) +
    (Headcount_Growth_Score × 0.20)

CC_Revenue_Growth = HIB(Constant Currency Growth%, floor=5, ceiling=20)
```

Constant currency growth and TCV are typically disclosed in management commentary, not in XBRL. The `event_analyzer` and `announcement_classifier` should extract these from results filings — a structured field for `cc_revenue_growth` in `corporate_event_signals` is recommended (Section 11).

#### Profitability

```
Profitability = 
    (EBIT_Margin_Score × 0.50) +
    (ROCE_Score × 0.30) +
    (FCF_Conversion_Score × 0.20)

EBIT_Margin_Score (tiered by market cap from sector_master):
    Large-cap IT (mcap > ₹2L cr): HIB(margin, floor=15, ceiling=25)
    Mid-cap IT:                    HIB(margin, floor=12, ceiling=22)
    Small-cap IT:                  HIB(margin, floor=10, ceiling=20)

ROCE_Score             = HIB(ROCE%, floor=20, ceiling=40)
FCF_Conversion_Score   = HIB(FCF/Net Profit, floor=0.7, ceiling=1.2)
```

#### Operational Metrics

```
Operational = 
    (Utilization_Score × 0.30) +
    (Attrition_Score × 0.40) +
    (Offshore_Ratio_Score × 0.30)

Attrition_Score = LIB(LTM Attrition%, floor=12, ceiling=25)
```

Attrition is disclosed in quarterly results — `event_analyzer` should extract this into `corporate_event_signals`.

#### IT Red Flags

| Red Flag | Penalty |
|---|---|
| `MARGIN_COMPRESSION` (>200 bps QoQ) | −10 |
| `LARGE_CLIENT_LOSS` (>5% revenue) | −15 |
| `KEY_MANAGEMENT_EXIT` (CEO/COO) | −10 |
| `VISA_REGULATORY_DISRUPTION` | −5 |
| `WHISTLEBLOWER_OR_GOVERNANCE` complaint | −20 |

