## Appendix B: Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|---|---|
| ALM | Asset-Liability Management — matching tenor of borrowings to lending book |
| ANDA | Abbreviated New Drug Application (US generic drug approval) |
| BB | Bollinger Bands |
| CASA | Current Account + Savings Account deposits (cheap funding for banks) |
| CAR | Capital Adequacy Ratio (capital / risk-weighted assets) |
| CC | Constant Currency (revenue stripped of FX effects) |
| CET1 | Common Equity Tier 1 capital ratio |
| GNPA / NNPA | Gross / Net Non-Performing Assets |
| HIB | Higher-Is-Better (normalization direction) |
| LIB | Lower-Is-Better (normalization direction) |
| LCR | Liquidity Coverage Ratio |
| NIM | Net Interest Margin |
| OB | Order Book |
| PCA | Prompt Corrective Action (RBI restriction on weak banks) |
| PCR | Provision Coverage Ratio (provisions / GNPA) |
| ROCE | Return on Capital Employed |
| TCV | Total Contract Value (signed deal value for IT services) |
| WC | Working Capital |

